WEBVTT

01:32.069 --> 01:37.387
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.387 --> 01:40.446
[Episode 16]

01:41.640 --> 01:44.599
I was only 18 when my husband died.

01:44.599 --> 01:46.439
Since then, I never remarried.

01:47.400 --> 01:49.640
Over the years, I have maintained a fleet,

01:49.640 --> 01:51.159
trading in all places.

01:51.159 --> 01:52.680
I've even been to foreign lands.

01:52.680 --> 01:54.640
I've heard all sorts of rumors and slanders.

01:56.200 --> 01:58.719
If it weren't for my ability
to discern truth from falsehood

01:58.719 --> 02:00.640
and not fear unconventional judgment,

02:00.640 --> 02:02.120
how could I have survived to this day?

02:02.840 --> 02:04.239
In this world,

02:04.239 --> 02:06.040
life for women is truly not easy.

02:07.120 --> 02:09.199
We should help and understand each other.

02:12.759 --> 02:14.599
What do you say?

02:14.599 --> 02:16.159
Would you consider

02:16.159 --> 02:17.599
becoming my niece-in-law?

02:18.479 --> 02:21.000
Even if you spend all his money

02:21.000 --> 02:22.400
and make him work every day,

02:22.400 --> 02:23.680
I would be happy to see it happen.

02:24.360 --> 02:26.039
A woman's destiny

02:26.039 --> 02:27.479
is marriage.

02:27.479 --> 02:28.759
Without a family or status,

02:28.759 --> 02:30.919
one will ultimately be taken advantage of.

02:32.840 --> 02:33.879
If so,

02:34.520 --> 02:35.919
why haven't you remarried?

02:37.919 --> 02:39.360
Because I am well-off enough

02:39.360 --> 02:40.560
to live well on my own

02:41.080 --> 02:42.319
and I'm even able to help

02:42.319 --> 02:44.319
many handsome young men.

02:47.960 --> 02:50.599
If you are strong and wealthy enough,

02:50.599 --> 02:52.560
naturally, you won't need to depend on anyone.

02:55.120 --> 02:57.439
Otherwise, you still need to find someone

02:57.439 --> 02:59.800
worthy of entrusting your life to.

03:02.360 --> 03:04.439
I see.

03:04.439 --> 03:06.159
I still have to work hard on my own.

03:07.960 --> 03:09.319
Mudan.

03:09.319 --> 03:11.520
My nephew is handsome and clever.

03:12.520 --> 03:14.479
Do you not feel anything for him?

03:18.759 --> 03:20.479
Then tell me,

03:20.479 --> 03:22.000
what kind of man

03:22.000 --> 03:25.319
- Do you fancy?
- I think…

03:25.319 --> 03:27.240
Don't tell me you will never marry.

03:27.240 --> 03:28.712
I won't believe that.

03:33.199 --> 03:35.199
I think if one day,

03:35.960 --> 03:38.319
I find myself unexpectedly in a dire situation

03:39.120 --> 03:41.960
and someone descends
from the sky clothed in rosy clouds,

03:41.960 --> 03:43.080
coming to my side

03:43.719 --> 03:45.080
to help me dispel the gloom,

03:46.120 --> 03:48.319
perhaps, I would be touched.

03:49.759 --> 03:51.280
But it's not that I need him

03:51.280 --> 03:52.439
to rescue me.

03:53.199 --> 03:54.680
I hope this person

03:55.319 --> 03:57.039
can understand me better than I do myself.

03:58.520 --> 03:59.840
Even if I don't say a word,

04:00.360 --> 04:02.439
he knows all my likes, dislikes,

04:02.439 --> 04:04.080
decisions, and dreams.

04:05.240 --> 04:06.960
No matter what desperate situation I fall into,

04:07.960 --> 04:09.680
he can face it with me together.

04:13.919 --> 04:15.120
My nephew

04:15.639 --> 04:17.439
is indeed quite far

04:17.959 --> 04:19.439
from your expectations.

04:21.959 --> 04:24.839
I also know that this kind of mutual
understanding and affection

04:24.839 --> 04:26.079
is rare in this world.

04:26.079 --> 04:28.439
So I have never expected it.

04:35.592 --> 04:38.056
[Jiang Mansion]

04:39.319 --> 04:41.920
I have clearly said no to Madam Feng.

04:41.920 --> 04:43.600
And she has accepted it.

04:44.319 --> 04:45.639
Madam Feng is persistent.

04:45.639 --> 04:46.720
She retreats to advance again.

04:46.720 --> 04:48.519
She is currently coming up with a new plan,

04:48.519 --> 04:50.240
and my lord wishes to discuss
strategies with you

04:50.240 --> 04:51.240
to present a united front.

04:55.040 --> 04:56.120
He is inside.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.120
That's an odd arrangement
for a strategy discussion.

05:09.480 --> 05:10.792
Jiang Changyang.

05:13.519 --> 05:15.279
If we're just discussing, why close the door?

05:15.920 --> 05:16.920
Lady He.

05:16.920 --> 05:18.680
My lord said it must be kept confidential.

05:23.800 --> 05:25.279
Jiang Changyang.

05:25.279 --> 05:26.480
If we are discussing strategies,

05:27.240 --> 05:28.800
why have you arranged the room like this?

05:29.759 --> 05:31.279
There's no need for such a big fuss, right?

05:37.480 --> 05:38.728
He Weifang.

05:40.199 --> 05:41.959
Jiang Changyang.

05:41.959 --> 05:43.560
He Weifang.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.560
Don't scare me, Jiang Changyang.

05:49.199 --> 05:50.824
He Weifang.

05:57.000 --> 05:58.759
What? What are you doing?

05:59.759 --> 06:01.079
What happened?

06:01.079 --> 06:02.759
Let me down quickly.

06:02.759 --> 06:03.879
I… How should I put you down?

06:03.879 --> 06:05.439
Over there, that way.

06:05.439 --> 06:06.680
Pull, pull it.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.816
This one?

06:11.800 --> 06:13.600
Jiang Changyang.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.759
What is all this?

06:16.439 --> 06:17.920
He Weifang.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.439
Isn't this what you told my aunt?

06:20.040 --> 06:21.560
Your beloved one

06:21.560 --> 06:23.279
needs to descend from the heavens in darkness

06:23.279 --> 06:25.240
clothed in rosy clouds.

06:25.759 --> 06:26.759
Are you happy

06:27.279 --> 06:28.720
about this?

06:28.720 --> 06:30.120
But I was lying.

06:31.399 --> 06:32.680
What about Chuanyu?

06:32.680 --> 06:33.959
Don't mention that traitor to me.

06:35.839 --> 06:37.279
What's going on here?

06:37.279 --> 06:38.279
He Weifang.

06:38.279 --> 06:39.639
Untie me first.

06:46.279 --> 06:48.920
Madam Feng.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.199
Even if Jiang Changyang meets

06:50.199 --> 06:52.040
all the requirements I've set,

06:52.040 --> 06:53.800
it's impossible for me to like him.

06:53.800 --> 06:55.800
Just let us out.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.920
Mudan.

06:56.920 --> 06:59.639
I have already thoroughly reformed Suizhi

06:59.639 --> 07:00.879
to meet the standards

07:00.879 --> 07:01.879
of your beloved.

07:03.000 --> 07:04.439
I will give you four hours

07:04.439 --> 07:05.560
to listen to his confession.

07:06.240 --> 07:07.680
If you still do not change your mind,

07:07.680 --> 07:08.879
I will not force you.

07:09.680 --> 07:11.879
After all, I've prepared

07:12.480 --> 07:13.960
the betrothal gifts and apology gifts.

07:13.960 --> 07:15.199
Lady He.

07:15.920 --> 07:16.920
My lord.

07:16.920 --> 07:18.639
I… I sincerely apologize to you.

07:20.199 --> 07:21.800
How can you be so superficial?

07:22.319 --> 07:23.360
If they really end up married

07:23.360 --> 07:24.800
because of this,

07:24.800 --> 07:26.319
they would be thanking you.

07:27.120 --> 07:28.480
I have indeed been superficial, Madam.

07:30.360 --> 07:32.199
Suizhi.

07:32.199 --> 07:33.319
Be sure to correct your attitude

07:33.319 --> 07:34.639
and behave well.

07:34.639 --> 07:35.720
Otherwise, on returning,

07:35.720 --> 07:37.759
you will kneel before the tablet
and face the whip again.

07:39.519 --> 07:40.839
Traitor.

07:40.839 --> 07:42.680
Chuanyu really is a traitor.

07:47.519 --> 07:48.639
You wanted to face desperate

07:48.639 --> 07:50.279
circumstances with another person, right?

07:50.279 --> 07:52.519
So Aunt tried to satisfy you.

07:54.639 --> 07:56.392
Untie me.

08:05.240 --> 08:06.279
With your level of ability,

08:07.079 --> 08:08.160
you can't compete with my aunt.

08:09.120 --> 08:10.319
I really overestimated you.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.488
Compensate me.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.240
That's not the deal.

08:18.879 --> 08:20.800
I worked hard to reject you.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.040
And now,

08:23.040 --> 08:24.160
you want to kick down the ladder?

08:24.959 --> 08:26.360
Have you thought about the consequences?

08:28.639 --> 08:30.319
Your aunt hasn't left yet.

08:33.480 --> 08:36.519
Since Mr. Jiang is so fond of me,

08:37.080 --> 08:39.759
having no way to repay,
shall we fulfill Aunt's wishes?

08:39.759 --> 08:40.759
Fine, no compensation.

08:43.879 --> 08:45.480
You little scoundrel.

08:45.480 --> 08:47.240
One day a lump of gold will smash you to death.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.128
Thank you for your kind words.

08:52.200 --> 08:53.960
What's all this clanging and banging?

08:55.559 --> 08:57.200
You told Aunt

08:57.200 --> 08:58.679
that your beloved needs to understand

08:58.679 --> 09:00.200
all your likes, dislikes, and decisions.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.200
She tortured me severely

09:02.200 --> 09:03.279
and forced it out of me.

09:03.279 --> 09:04.279
What could I do?

09:06.000 --> 09:07.360
How do you know

09:07.360 --> 09:09.159
[Likes to drink osmanthus wine]
I like to drink osmanthus wine?

09:11.320 --> 09:13.559
[Likes to eat dried fish]
And that I like to eat dried fish?

09:14.080 --> 09:15.559
You've invited me to eat it several times.

09:15.559 --> 09:16.840
My taste buds haven't gone bad.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.000
My foot is eight and a half inches long.

09:23.159 --> 09:25.080
You know this too?

09:25.080 --> 09:27.120
I've never seen anyone
with feet bigger than yours.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.320
Naturally, it's hard to forget.

09:35.559 --> 09:36.799
Your aunt probably wants us

09:36.799 --> 09:37.799
to share our preferences.

09:38.759 --> 09:41.639
[Afraid of cockroaches]
I never expected Jiang Suizhi

09:41.639 --> 09:43.279
to actually be afraid of cockroaches.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.879
That's not true. She's making it up.

09:51.320 --> 09:53.480
Then do you know that cockroaches are edible?

09:54.120 --> 09:57.200
Once we're out,
I'll cook you a full insect feast.

09:57.200 --> 09:59.639
If you have the guts, eat it all.

10:01.000 --> 10:02.360
Let me see.

10:02.360 --> 10:05.200
What else would Jiang Changyang be afraid of?

10:05.200 --> 10:07.440
- Don't look.
- Didn't you say she made it up?

10:07.440 --> 10:08.440
If so, what are you afraid of?

10:08.440 --> 10:09.440
Why pull them down?

10:09.440 --> 10:10.960
Let me see.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.200
Why are you afraid?

10:12.200 --> 10:13.399
I want to see what's written.

10:13.399 --> 10:14.504
You can't look.

10:15.320 --> 10:18.600
Jiang Changyang wet the bed when he was little.

10:26.664 --> 10:29.256
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

10:29.256 --> 10:33.192
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

10:33.192 --> 10:35.762
♫ It sinks into your gaze ♫

10:35.762 --> 10:39.496
♫ Melting and flowing with you ♫

10:39.496 --> 10:41.896
♫ If love is like frost ♫

10:41.896 --> 10:46.280
♫ Can this ten thousand miles
of roaming winds and waves ♫

10:46.280 --> 10:53.384
♫ Finally touch a sunny day ♫

11:02.320 --> 11:03.960
I'm full.

11:03.960 --> 11:05.064
Sit down.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.919
Last night's atmosphere was very good,

11:15.919 --> 11:17.600
but how come Mudan hasn't agreed to you yet?

11:20.679 --> 11:22.679
She is different from other women.

11:23.480 --> 11:25.320
She's not interested in those flashy ornaments.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.879
Aunt, please don't make things worse.

11:27.879 --> 11:28.879
Just let us be.

11:29.639 --> 11:30.720
I think

11:30.720 --> 11:31.960
you're just too stubborn.

11:32.879 --> 11:34.320
The people who surround you on a daily basis

11:34.320 --> 11:35.840
are women from pleasure quarters.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.960
Mudan is capable and intelligent.

11:37.960 --> 11:39.200
Of course, she's different from them.

11:39.919 --> 11:41.600
You ought to be more tolerant and gentle.

11:42.200 --> 11:43.519
If you don't behave well,

11:43.519 --> 11:45.159
are you expecting her to please you?

11:46.120 --> 11:47.879
Before you came, Auntie,

11:47.879 --> 11:49.399
she was trying to please me

11:49.399 --> 11:50.559
because of my lechery.

11:50.559 --> 11:52.399
I think your previous actions

11:52.399 --> 11:54.000
are exactly the reason

11:54.000 --> 11:56.440
why she doesn't dare to talk to you
about private matters of men and women.

11:59.560 --> 12:00.759
Madam.

12:00.759 --> 12:03.720
What is the traitor doing here
this early in the morning?

12:05.279 --> 12:07.200
Did Mudan accept the apology gift?

12:07.200 --> 12:08.600
She is stingy.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.759
She wouldn't say no to money given for free.

12:10.600 --> 12:12.720
Yes, Lady He has accepted the things.

12:12.720 --> 12:14.519
She has asked me to pass on her regards.

12:14.519 --> 12:15.559
Did she say anything else?

12:16.360 --> 12:17.440
When I was there,

12:17.440 --> 12:19.360
Lady He's shop seemed to be
in some kind of trouble.

12:19.360 --> 12:20.720
She hurried out

12:20.720 --> 12:21.799
and said nothing else.

12:21.799 --> 12:23.432
Trouble?

12:25.000 --> 12:26.039
That's good.

12:27.000 --> 12:29.240
That's the perfect opportunity
for you to show your merit.

12:31.039 --> 12:32.679
Indeed, a woman's heart is the most venomous.

12:34.840 --> 12:36.200
Fellow residents,

12:36.200 --> 12:37.679
neighbors,

12:37.679 --> 12:39.799
you must stand up for me.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.159
Huamanzhu's

12:44.120 --> 12:46.159
shopkeeper lady brings tough luck to husbands,

12:46.159 --> 12:48.480
yet she still comes out
to do business in public.

12:49.559 --> 12:51.039
You've caused my husband

12:51.039 --> 12:52.799
to be sick and bedridden.

12:53.320 --> 12:55.200
You must compensate for my husband.

12:55.200 --> 12:57.279
Such nonsense could be charged
with the crime of slander.

12:57.279 --> 12:58.399
That's punishable by caning.

12:58.399 --> 12:59.799
It's not nonsense.

12:59.799 --> 13:00.960
Ever since I bought this incense powder

13:00.960 --> 13:02.080
from Huamanzhu,

13:02.919 --> 13:05.200
every time I get close to my husband,

13:05.200 --> 13:07.000
he gets dizzy and disoriented.

13:07.000 --> 13:09.240
His limbs go weak. It's very strange.

13:09.240 --> 13:11.240
Later, after consulting
a geomancer, I came to know

13:11.759 --> 13:13.320
that the incense powder from Huamanzhu

13:13.320 --> 13:15.440
is tainted with malevolent energy

13:15.440 --> 13:16.960
and it has overcome my husband.

13:19.840 --> 13:21.200
Why would you speak of others in such a way?

13:21.200 --> 13:22.440
Your husband has fallen ill,

13:22.440 --> 13:23.840
and instead of seeking a doctor,

13:23.840 --> 13:25.879
you found a practitioner of arcane arts.

13:25.879 --> 13:27.440
Do you have a guilty conscience?

13:27.440 --> 13:29.039
Shall I have a doctor

13:29.039 --> 13:31.039
visit your home and take a look?

13:32.000 --> 13:33.120
I, of course, I…

13:33.120 --> 13:34.120
I sought out a doctor first.

13:34.120 --> 13:35.440
But he couldn't discern any issue.

13:35.440 --> 13:36.799
That's why I turned to a geomancer.

13:37.679 --> 13:39.399
Geomancer, can you figure out

13:39.399 --> 13:41.000
what exactly is the problem with her?

13:43.720 --> 13:44.879
This woman

13:44.879 --> 13:46.720
is destined to the Seven Killings,

13:46.720 --> 13:48.159
bringing calamity and malevolence.

13:48.720 --> 13:51.360
And recently she's even
been possessed by evil spirits,

13:51.360 --> 13:53.480
drawing on the fortune
and prosperity of her neighbors

13:53.480 --> 13:54.879
to increase her own wealth.

13:55.480 --> 13:57.480
She is actually a demon!

13:57.480 --> 13:59.399
- And to think we trusted her so much.
- It's all trickery.

13:59.399 --> 14:00.759
Malicious slander.

14:00.759 --> 14:02.360
You are spreading rumors and defamation.

14:03.279 --> 14:05.399
I'll make you pay for your wild claims!

14:05.399 --> 14:07.039
Fu, don't fall for his trickery.

14:07.039 --> 14:08.720
If we injure them,

14:08.720 --> 14:10.039
it would be our fault instead.

14:10.039 --> 14:11.360
But we can't let them make a scene.

14:11.879 --> 14:14.360
I advise the shop owner to quickly kneel down

14:14.879 --> 14:17.919
and let me expel the evil spirit within you.

14:17.919 --> 14:19.799
Otherwise, you'll bring harm to all around.

14:19.799 --> 14:21.039
That's truly a sinful act.

14:23.519 --> 14:25.879
Fine, in my entire life,

14:25.879 --> 14:27.480
I've indeed never encountered any evil spirits.

14:28.279 --> 14:29.519
I'll stand right here

14:30.080 --> 14:31.480
and see what this evil spirit

14:31.480 --> 14:33.279
you speak of looks like.

14:34.159 --> 14:35.399
Let me reveal my true form then!

14:35.399 --> 14:36.520
Come on.

14:37.120 --> 14:39.840
This demon is using your body

14:39.840 --> 14:42.320
to absorb others' fortunes.

14:42.320 --> 14:44.120
It harms others,

14:44.120 --> 14:46.559
and it's normal for you to be unaware.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.360
I will now perform a ritual

14:48.360 --> 14:50.600
to drive out the demon within you.

14:50.600 --> 14:52.000
You will thank me for it.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.544
Come on.

15:15.464 --> 15:16.519
It's smoking.

15:16.519 --> 15:18.720
Reveal your true form immediately!

15:36.559 --> 15:37.559
The smoke in your hand

15:38.200 --> 15:40.200
must be caused by the flint
you smeared in advance, right?

15:40.200 --> 15:42.480
Do you dare to show your hand to everyone?

15:43.240 --> 15:44.399
With death knocking at your door,

15:44.399 --> 15:45.679
you still spout bewitching nonsense.

15:53.000 --> 15:55.679
Evil spirit, reveal your true form immediately!

15:55.679 --> 15:56.744
Break.

16:00.679 --> 16:01.799
Broken. It's broken!

16:02.759 --> 16:03.840
What on earth is this?

16:04.440 --> 16:05.480
Ren!

16:05.480 --> 16:06.639
- Ren!
- Ren.

16:07.159 --> 16:08.879
- What happened?
- What's wrong?

16:08.879 --> 16:09.799
- Quickly save him!
- How come he's vomiting blood?

16:09.799 --> 16:11.200
Everyone, come take a look quickly.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.600
This demon is too vicious.

16:12.600 --> 16:14.600
In order to remain in her physical body,

16:14.600 --> 16:15.600
she uses her helper

16:15.600 --> 16:17.720
to withstand my magic.

16:17.720 --> 16:19.600
Shopkeeper, your murderous aura is strong.

16:19.600 --> 16:21.840
If you come any closer,
he won't live much longer.

16:21.840 --> 16:23.120
Drop the act.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.679
What kind of drug did you give my assistant?

16:24.679 --> 16:25.799
I'm telling you,

16:25.799 --> 16:28.159
if anything happens to him,
I won't let you off.

16:28.159 --> 16:29.399
- Slandering!
- Fu, find a doctor.

16:29.399 --> 16:31.600
- Okay.
- Go, quickly.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.279
You've cursed my husband with illness,

16:33.279 --> 16:35.200
and now you've struck down your own assistant.

16:35.200 --> 16:36.840
I'm afraid it won't be many days

16:36.840 --> 16:38.279
before all the people in Huamanzhu

16:38.279 --> 16:40.200
are cursed to death by you.

16:40.200 --> 16:41.759
Quickly, carry him away.

16:42.679 --> 16:43.799
What are you doing?

16:43.799 --> 16:45.000
Don't touch him.

16:45.000 --> 16:46.039
Don't touch him!

16:46.039 --> 16:47.960
By obstructing like this,
you're going to cost his life.

16:47.960 --> 16:49.519
- Right.
- Saving him is what's important.

16:50.679 --> 16:51.799
- Geomancer, save me!
- Get back.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.519
Geomancer.

16:53.519 --> 16:56.440
Geomancer, save me, sir.

16:57.279 --> 16:58.960
Ever since I came to Huamanzhu,

16:58.960 --> 17:01.120
my health has declined day by day.

17:02.159 --> 17:03.679
Just now, when the bronze mirror shattered,

17:04.360 --> 17:06.839
as if in a trance, I saw a demon attacking me,

17:07.559 --> 17:08.839
then I lost consciousness.

17:09.920 --> 17:12.319
Geomancer, sir, you must save me.

17:12.319 --> 17:14.359
Geomancer, take me with you, sir.

17:14.359 --> 17:16.519
Rest assured, I will definitely save you.

17:17.240 --> 17:19.599
- Come on, take him away.
- Did you hear that?

17:19.599 --> 17:21.119
You can't come to Huamanzhu.

17:21.119 --> 17:22.559
It's dangerous.

17:24.039 --> 17:25.160
I didn't lie.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.519
A life is at stake.

17:26.519 --> 17:27.960
I'll let you go for now today.

17:28.599 --> 17:30.319
If the shop owner still has a conscience,

17:30.319 --> 17:31.880
please close your shop.

17:31.880 --> 17:33.240
Do not further torment the neighbors.

17:33.920 --> 17:35.112
Evil spirit.

17:36.039 --> 17:37.559
My lady, you can't seem to get pregnant.

17:37.559 --> 17:38.839
Could it be because our shop

17:38.839 --> 17:40.200
is right next to this Huamanzhu?

17:40.799 --> 17:43.039
Let's leave now. Don't get
contaminated by the evil aura.

17:43.039 --> 17:44.104
- Let's go.
- Hurry up.

17:44.104 --> 17:50.716
♫ The world builds high walls for me ♫

17:55.240 --> 17:59.325
[Huamanzhu]

18:00.136 --> 18:06.279
♫ With a lowly status,
I have nothing to lean on ♫

18:06.279 --> 18:08.599
Madam, I don't believe a single word

18:08.599 --> 18:10.160
of what the Geomancer said.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.319
I will always follow you.

18:13.599 --> 18:14.759
Mudan.

18:14.759 --> 18:16.599
What are we going to do?

18:16.599 --> 18:21.759
♫ Ah, do not sigh for fate is unpredictable ♫

18:21.759 --> 18:22.888
Alright then.

18:23.720 --> 18:25.000
Since the flower guild is so frowned

18:25.000 --> 18:26.160
upon by us women doing business,

18:27.359 --> 18:29.160
don't blame us for following suit.

18:33.799 --> 18:36.279
Mother, this jade bracelet is so pretty.

18:36.279 --> 18:37.960
It suits me very well.

18:38.839 --> 18:40.920
If you like it, let's buy it.

18:40.920 --> 18:42.720
You are the best, Mother.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.440
Lian'er.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.480
I actually bought a special peony plant

18:47.480 --> 18:48.920
to show you, Auntie.

18:49.839 --> 18:52.079
Unfortunately, you came too late,
and the blooming season is over.

18:52.759 --> 18:53.920
So I just have to find

18:53.920 --> 18:55.160
another way to show my respect for you.

18:57.559 --> 18:59.000
This color is not pretty.

18:59.000 --> 19:01.000
It's too old-fashioned.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.759
If you really wanted to show respect to me,

19:02.759 --> 19:03.880
after eating breakfast,

19:03.880 --> 19:05.559
you should have gone to save the beauty.

19:05.559 --> 19:06.720
Shop owner.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.720
None of your jingling hairpins

19:07.720 --> 19:09.640
can match my auntie's beauty.

19:09.640 --> 19:10.960
Bring out the best if there's any better.

19:11.759 --> 19:13.279
Yes.

19:13.279 --> 19:14.960
Why are you still using this?

19:14.960 --> 19:16.319
Haven't you heard?

19:16.319 --> 19:18.559
The Huamanzhu shop owner
is fated with an evil presence.

19:18.559 --> 19:19.880
She has led to the death of three husbands.

19:20.440 --> 19:23.039
And now she's even possessed by evil spirits.

19:23.039 --> 19:24.279
The things she sells

19:24.279 --> 19:25.759
are all tainted with evil aura.

19:25.759 --> 19:28.640
If used for too long, at the least,
it can lead to marital discord.

19:28.640 --> 19:30.359
At worst, it can bring about misfortune

19:30.359 --> 19:31.640
and serious sickness.

19:31.640 --> 19:34.240
Is that true? You can't just talk nonsense.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.599
It's absolutely true.

19:35.599 --> 19:37.359
The renowned geomancer Master Zhang

19:37.359 --> 19:38.839
has just gone there to exorcise evils.

19:38.839 --> 19:40.720
But the demon was too powerful.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.920
A worker from Huamanzhu

19:41.920 --> 19:43.119
vomited blood on the spot.

19:43.680 --> 19:44.880
That's unlucky.

19:45.839 --> 19:47.319
Gullibly believing in ignorant words,

19:47.319 --> 19:49.119
spreading rumors and damaging reputations,

19:49.640 --> 19:51.640
such behavior does not
befit a noble's household.

19:52.440 --> 19:53.920
We're just chatting privately.

19:53.920 --> 19:56.119
It's nothing serious.

19:56.119 --> 19:57.440
I didn't know Floral Envoy was here.

19:57.440 --> 19:59.720
We apologize for disturbing you.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.920
We will leave right away.

20:00.920 --> 20:02.056
Let's go.

20:09.319 --> 20:11.440
Using such means against a woman,

20:11.440 --> 20:12.519
it's really despicable.

20:15.279 --> 20:16.880
The rumors are getting worse.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.880
This is a good opportunity.

20:18.880 --> 20:20.519
What are you waiting for?

20:21.680 --> 20:22.920
If she can't handle it,

20:22.920 --> 20:24.119
she will come to me.

20:24.119 --> 20:25.599
Why should I be so eager?

20:25.599 --> 20:27.680
It's as if I don't believe in her abilities.

20:27.680 --> 20:30.079
Whether she seeks you out is her decision.

20:30.079 --> 20:31.240
But whether or not
to take the initiative to help

20:31.240 --> 20:32.440
reveals your intentions.

20:33.359 --> 20:35.839
I thought you wanted
to show your respect to me.

20:36.839 --> 20:38.319
Go.

20:38.319 --> 20:39.720
Fine.

20:39.720 --> 20:41.960
I'll send Chuanyu to scout, alright?

21:28.440 --> 21:29.559
You made the rule.

21:29.559 --> 21:30.559
Knock before entering.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.319
You encountered such slander.

21:56.000 --> 21:57.039
Not only is your complexion usual,

21:57.039 --> 21:59.279
but it's even ruddy.

21:59.279 --> 22:00.880
Are you really a fairy?

22:01.880 --> 22:03.640
This shows that Huamanzhu's business is good,

22:03.640 --> 22:05.119
obstructing others' path to wealth.

22:05.119 --> 22:07.200
Such things are inevitable.

22:07.200 --> 22:09.000
If I get upset about it,

22:09.000 --> 22:10.599
I'm giving the rumormongers an advantage.

22:12.599 --> 22:13.680
My aunt really should see

22:13.680 --> 22:15.240
this heartless and unfeeling manner of yours.

22:16.960 --> 22:18.480
She forced me to help.

22:18.480 --> 22:19.599
Otherwise,

22:19.599 --> 22:21.319
I won't bother with this trivial matter.

22:21.319 --> 22:22.680
Yes, yes, I know.

22:23.359 --> 22:25.200
The Floral Envoy is busy with noble matters.

22:25.720 --> 22:27.359
If not for being lazy and gluttonous,

22:27.359 --> 22:29.079
how would you deign to visit me here?

22:29.079 --> 22:30.400
I will keep

22:30.400 --> 22:31.559
this favor

22:31.559 --> 22:33.000
on Madam Feng's account.

22:38.680 --> 22:39.720
Has the sly flower merchant

22:39.720 --> 22:41.680
thought of a way to solve the issue?

22:43.839 --> 22:46.079
I have already set up the stage.

22:46.079 --> 22:47.200
Now,

22:47.200 --> 22:49.119
all that's missing is someone like you,

22:49.119 --> 22:50.839
a famous actor

22:50.839 --> 22:52.519
capable of bewitching people's hearts.

22:54.119 --> 22:56.680
I should have named you Jiang Bold.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.920
You dare to have the grand Floral Envoy

22:57.920 --> 22:59.039
be your actor.

23:00.240 --> 23:02.279
You are acting every day anyway.

23:02.279 --> 23:03.319
It won't matter this one time.

23:03.319 --> 23:06.240
Besides, my money is your money, after all.

23:08.079 --> 23:09.920
Speak up, what's your plan?

23:11.279 --> 23:13.559
If the evil spirits can possess someone,

23:13.559 --> 23:15.200
they can be exorcised.

23:15.200 --> 23:17.319
Since the other side can bribe a geomancer,

23:17.319 --> 23:19.319
why can't I?

23:19.319 --> 23:20.759
Besides Mr. Jiang,

23:20.759 --> 23:22.559
I will also invite another

23:22.559 --> 23:25.000
person with upright reputation to take action.

23:25.000 --> 23:27.240
At that time, we'll attack from both sides,

23:27.240 --> 23:28.936
ensuring there'll be no concerns.

23:29.720 --> 23:30.799
Who else do you plan to get?

23:34.600 --> 23:38.119
[Cao's Flower Shop]

23:38.119 --> 23:39.880
These are all recently acquired goods.

23:40.680 --> 23:42.160
Mr. Jiang, why didn't you

23:42.160 --> 23:43.519
say anything in advance

23:43.519 --> 23:44.880
so that I could clear out the other guests?

23:46.759 --> 23:48.328
Please, browse away.

23:52.160 --> 23:53.160
Mr. Jiang.

23:53.160 --> 23:54.359
If there's anything you fancy,

23:54.359 --> 23:56.559
I will immediately send someone

23:56.559 --> 23:57.680
to deliver it to your mansion.

24:09.319 --> 24:10.319
- Mr. Jiang.
- Mr. Jiang.

24:12.759 --> 24:13.920
- My lord!
- Mr. Jiang!

24:13.920 --> 24:14.640
- My lord.
- Mr. Jiang.

24:14.640 --> 24:15.480
- Mr. Jiang.
- Mr. Jiang.

24:15.480 --> 24:17.680
- My lord.
- What are you waiting for? Get a doctor!

24:17.680 --> 24:19.720
- Alright.
- My lord, my lord.

24:19.720 --> 24:20.759
- Mr. Jiang.
- My lord.

24:20.759 --> 24:23.519
[Huamanzhu]

24:23.519 --> 24:25.200
What happened to the Floral Envoy?

24:26.079 --> 24:28.279
Jiang Mansion has just bought
Herbaceous Peonies from Huamanzhu,

24:28.279 --> 24:30.160
and my lord started coughing up
blood and getting weak today.

24:30.160 --> 24:31.240
It must be your doing.

24:31.240 --> 24:33.039
Geomancer, hurry and expel the evil spirits!

24:33.039 --> 24:34.504
Alright.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.240
Could it be karma?

24:38.279 --> 24:39.680
I had heard that Huamanzhu

24:39.680 --> 24:40.799
was haunted by a malevolent spirit.

24:51.519 --> 24:52.680
How strange indeed.

24:53.960 --> 24:56.359
The shopkeeper does not have
a trace of malevolent aura.

24:56.359 --> 24:57.440
But instead, there is an increase

24:57.440 --> 24:59.119
of an auspicious aura.

24:59.119 --> 25:00.359
Auspicious?

25:00.359 --> 25:02.160
- Yes.
- An auspicious aura.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.319
Impossible.

25:03.319 --> 25:05.440
Then why has my lord
fallen gravely ill for no reason?

25:05.440 --> 25:07.119
Even the imperial physician
was at his wit's end.

25:07.119 --> 25:09.960
Do not worry, let me calculate carefully.

25:28.960 --> 25:31.400
Indeed, Mr. Jiang has been harmed by evil aura.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.960
But this evil aura

25:34.599 --> 25:35.720
originates from the sachet

25:35.720 --> 25:37.319
at Mr. Jiang's waist.

25:41.000 --> 25:42.599
This, this isn't from our shop.

25:42.599 --> 25:44.640
- The sachet?
- This isn't ours.

25:44.640 --> 25:46.160
- What?
- This isn't.

25:53.200 --> 25:55.960
Presumably, the shopkeeper
often did good deeds in the past,

25:56.599 --> 25:57.920
so this demon could not

25:57.920 --> 25:59.359
harbor evil aura in her body

25:59.359 --> 26:01.039
to grow stronger.

26:01.039 --> 26:02.720
Moreover, during these past few days,

26:02.720 --> 26:04.279
there has been a great shift
in the celestial patterns,

26:04.279 --> 26:07.160
so the demon had no means
to cause trouble here and has left.

26:08.559 --> 26:10.000
Where did it go then?

26:10.000 --> 26:11.519
Allow me to calculate carefully.

26:12.480 --> 26:13.880
This demon

26:13.880 --> 26:16.039
takes delight in the vitality of living beings

26:16.039 --> 26:17.680
and enjoys the essence of plants.

26:18.279 --> 26:20.599
Now it is at the largest flower shop

26:20.599 --> 26:22.160
in the eastern part of the city.

26:23.400 --> 26:25.039
In the East Market, the guild head Cao's

26:25.039 --> 26:26.359
flower house is the most prosperous one.

26:26.359 --> 26:27.400
Could it be…

26:27.400 --> 26:28.519
This sachet of mine

26:28.519 --> 26:29.880
was actually bought there.

26:29.880 --> 26:31.240
See? It all adds up.

26:32.119 --> 26:34.519
Quickly! Fu, Shengyi, hurry, hurry.

26:35.920 --> 26:38.400
Ladies and gentlemen,
due to the matter of the evil spirit before,

26:39.039 --> 26:40.400
I feared implicating everyone

26:40.400 --> 26:43.160
so I fasted and meditated
in silence for three days

26:43.160 --> 26:45.359
to make a batch of brocade sachets.

26:46.000 --> 26:49.000
I had the master
from Kaiyuan Temple bless them.

26:50.759 --> 26:53.000
I will gift this item to Mr. Jiang.

26:53.000 --> 26:55.200
I hope Mr. Jiang can recover soon.

26:56.119 --> 26:57.480
Wait a moment.

26:58.920 --> 27:00.232
Geomancer.

27:09.599 --> 27:13.880
I have examined it, and this item truly can
ward off evil and bring fortune.

27:24.039 --> 27:25.880
[Warding Off Evil, Prosperity Sachet]
Ladies and gentlemen, ladies and gentlemen.

27:25.880 --> 27:27.119
Huamanzhu

27:27.119 --> 27:28.319
has invited a master

27:28.319 --> 27:29.880
to rearrange the Fengshui

27:29.880 --> 27:31.079
and asked Kaiyuan Temple

27:31.079 --> 27:32.599
to bless these Prosperity Sachets

27:32.599 --> 27:33.880
with activating charms and blessings.

27:33.880 --> 27:36.039
In order to compensate
for the loss of the neighbors,

27:36.039 --> 27:38.680
I am willing to give away
these sachets for free.

27:38.680 --> 27:41.200
And the remaining sachets
will be sold as usual.

27:41.200 --> 27:42.400
I also hope that everyone can

27:42.400 --> 27:43.799
support us generously.

27:43.799 --> 27:46.440
Geomancer, is Huamanzhu free from trouble now?

27:46.440 --> 27:48.000
Yes, indeed.

27:48.000 --> 27:49.960
The shopkeeper has gone to great lengths.

27:49.960 --> 27:52.880
This 'Hundred Fortunes Picture' matches
the shopkeeper's destiny perfectly.

27:54.119 --> 27:55.160
The shop now

27:55.160 --> 27:56.880
harbors fortune and accumulates prosperity,

27:56.880 --> 27:58.119
bringing luck to the home
and glory to the people.

27:58.119 --> 28:00.279
Everyone is welcome to visit in great numbers.

28:00.839 --> 28:02.559
You will certainly be filled with good fortune.

28:02.559 --> 28:03.880
No need to worry anymore.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.880
Good, good!

28:05.880 --> 28:07.848
Wait a moment.

28:09.240 --> 28:10.920
After wearing this sachet,

28:10.920 --> 28:12.519
I do feel better.

28:16.200 --> 28:18.359
And my limbs no longer feel as heavy

28:18.359 --> 28:19.519
as they did before.

28:19.519 --> 28:21.279
How great is that, huh?

28:22.000 --> 28:23.640
Thank you for gifting me this item.

28:23.640 --> 28:24.720
Mr. Jiang, you are welcome.

28:25.599 --> 28:28.720
From now on, all flowers for the Jiang Mansion
will be bought from Huamanzhu.

28:30.119 --> 28:32.799
If anyone in my mansion wishes
to buy incense powder for their wives,

28:32.799 --> 28:34.200
they should also come to Huamanzhu.

28:34.200 --> 28:35.599
Yes.

28:35.599 --> 28:37.279
Thank you, Mr. Jiang.

28:37.279 --> 28:39.039
I will surely cultivate them with care

28:39.039 --> 28:40.960
and will not disappoint you.

28:44.759 --> 28:47.000
What a shoddy flower guild,
all show and no substance.

28:47.000 --> 28:48.440
Throw this filthy thing far away from me.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.608
Yes.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.559
Come on.

28:52.559 --> 28:53.680
Everybody, Prosperity Sachets

28:53.680 --> 28:55.359
are available to all the neighbors around.

28:55.359 --> 28:56.880
Come on, come on, just take
a prosperity sachet.

28:56.880 --> 28:58.839
- Fu, quickly distribute to everyone.
- Come on, come on, have a try.

28:58.839 --> 29:00.000
If you wish to buy a sachet,

29:00.000 --> 29:01.000
you may also enter the store.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.319
Come, this way, please.

29:02.319 --> 29:03.799
- Please, inside.
- This way, please.

29:03.799 --> 29:05.920
- Take your time, there's plenty.
- Come on, come on in.

29:06.680 --> 29:07.960
This way, please.

29:09.079 --> 29:10.720
Come on, please come inside.

29:10.720 --> 29:12.640
Take it easy, there's enough for everyone.

29:12.640 --> 29:13.720
It is full of good fortune.

29:13.720 --> 29:15.319
Come, everyone, this way, please.

29:17.039 --> 29:18.559
The teacher's lecture today
was truly interesting.

29:18.559 --> 29:20.519
Indeed, thanks to the fragrance of the sachets,

29:21.759 --> 29:22.839
I didn't feel sleepy today.

29:22.839 --> 29:24.328
[Imperial Academy]
Yes, indeed.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.240
It's full of fragrance.

29:28.079 --> 29:29.200
Thank you, Wenqing,

29:29.200 --> 29:30.599
for giving my sachet in advance

29:30.599 --> 29:31.640
to those few

29:31.640 --> 29:33.319
talented scholars.

29:33.319 --> 29:35.640
Now they have passed the exam,

29:35.640 --> 29:36.880
and I have also overcome the difficulty.

29:37.759 --> 29:39.319
We are flesh and blood relatives.

29:39.319 --> 29:40.400
There's no need for such formality.

29:40.960 --> 29:42.680
Seeing you establish yourself in Chang'an now

29:43.400 --> 29:45.064
brings me great comfort

29:46.200 --> 29:47.880
I've heard that the sachets from Huamanzhu

29:47.880 --> 29:49.000
are particularly effective.

29:49.000 --> 29:50.279
In the Imperial Academy entrance exam,

29:50.279 --> 29:51.559
students who wore the sachets

29:51.559 --> 29:52.720
all got selected.

29:52.720 --> 29:55.359
I've also heard that the Floral Envoy
who wore this sachet

29:55.359 --> 29:56.559
got healed of all ailments.

29:56.559 --> 29:57.880
And moreover, at the casino,

29:57.880 --> 29:58.960
he won for three days and nights straight.

29:58.960 --> 29:59.960
Is that so?

29:59.960 --> 30:01.359
Let's go buy one too.

30:01.359 --> 30:02.600
- Let's go.
- Let's go, let's go.

30:02.600 --> 30:05.383
[Huamanzhu]

30:07.960 --> 30:09.680
- Take care.
- Thank you.

30:09.680 --> 30:11.200
- Hello, which one would you like?
- This one is so beautiful.

30:11.200 --> 30:12.839
- This sachet is for changing luck.
- Okay, thank you.

30:13.799 --> 30:15.160
Madam, how much is this one?

30:15.720 --> 30:17.240
Cao Yuying lifted a stone

30:17.240 --> 30:18.720
and dropped it on his own foot.

30:18.720 --> 30:20.799
Now, not a single person goes to his shop.

30:22.279 --> 30:24.599
This is karma. Truly satisfying.

30:25.839 --> 30:26.880
Now the whole of Chang'an

30:26.880 --> 30:28.440
knows about Huamanzhu.

30:29.039 --> 30:30.319
This time, a misfortune turned into a blessing.

30:30.319 --> 30:32.119
It's also something I never expected.

30:32.119 --> 30:34.039
We've not only gained male customers,

30:34.039 --> 30:35.839
but also expanded our category of business

30:35.839 --> 30:36.960
to spices and sachets.

30:38.039 --> 30:40.039
It seems that our Huamanzhu branch will open

30:40.039 --> 30:41.079
very soon.

30:42.720 --> 30:43.960
- Come on, cheers.
- Come on.

30:45.079 --> 30:46.240
Cheers.

31:01.000 --> 31:02.599
I've consulted medical books

31:02.599 --> 31:03.799
to specially prepare this ointment.

31:05.079 --> 31:07.680
The hair nourished by this
will not only be black,

31:07.680 --> 31:08.839
but also retain a long-lasting fragrance.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.240
You are really thoughtful.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.279
I know

31:15.279 --> 31:17.160
that Jiang Changyang helped me

31:17.160 --> 31:19.119
because you spoke for me in private.

31:19.759 --> 31:20.960
I am very grateful.

31:22.000 --> 31:23.680
Madam, you are about to embark on a journey.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.480
I have specially selected three plants

31:25.480 --> 31:27.039
of rare and famous peonies.

31:28.079 --> 31:30.079
Madam, you must keep them.

31:30.079 --> 31:31.799
With people taking meticulous care of them,

31:31.799 --> 31:33.000
by next spring,

31:33.000 --> 31:34.000
they will be able to bloom.

31:36.759 --> 31:38.440
You are considerate in every aspect,

31:38.440 --> 31:39.480
lovable and sensible.

31:40.519 --> 31:42.039
You are a great match

31:42.039 --> 31:43.279
with Suizhi.

31:46.480 --> 31:48.359
Madam,

31:48.359 --> 31:50.319
please stop joking with me.

31:51.440 --> 31:53.160
I'm not worthy of the Floral Envoy.

31:54.559 --> 31:55.559
I have always been reluctant

31:55.559 --> 31:57.240
for him to be some Floral Envoy.

31:58.200 --> 32:00.319
If he has a family he wants to protect,

32:00.960 --> 32:03.039
perhaps then he can settle down,

32:03.039 --> 32:04.296
changing his way of life.

32:06.200 --> 32:09.039
Mudan, do you want to reconsider?

32:10.079 --> 32:11.279
If you marry him,

32:11.279 --> 32:13.079
there will be no in-laws to serve,

32:13.079 --> 32:15.000
and Suizhi ignores rules.

32:15.720 --> 32:16.920
In the days to come,

32:16.920 --> 32:18.839
he will surely let you do as you please.

32:22.160 --> 32:23.200
He can't let go of

32:23.200 --> 32:24.799
his parents' old affairs.

32:24.799 --> 32:26.200
With this knot in his heart,

32:26.200 --> 32:27.680
I'm afraid he won't get married.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.000
Did Suizhi

32:30.000 --> 32:31.319
actually disclose such private matters

32:31.319 --> 32:32.319
to you?

32:34.920 --> 32:35.920
So, you see,

32:36.440 --> 32:37.519
you should know

32:38.759 --> 32:40.480
that his usual grins and banter

32:40.480 --> 32:41.519
are all just a facade.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.839
He harbors

32:43.839 --> 32:44.839
pain in his heart.

32:47.799 --> 32:49.240
Why is that?

32:49.240 --> 32:51.000
Is it because of his parents?

32:54.240 --> 32:56.519
When the right moment comes,

32:56.519 --> 32:58.039
he will tell you.

33:04.920 --> 33:06.119
Mudan,

33:06.119 --> 33:08.079
even if you don't like Suizhi,

33:08.799 --> 33:11.359
could you, when he is lonely and in sorrow,

33:11.359 --> 33:12.480
spend more time with him?

33:13.160 --> 33:14.599
Over the years,

33:14.599 --> 33:16.160
he has been truly too lonely.

33:24.680 --> 33:25.880
Madam.

33:25.880 --> 33:27.200
I'm afraid I can't

33:27.200 --> 33:28.440
fulfill your request.

33:30.359 --> 33:31.559
Actually, I have deceived you.

33:32.759 --> 33:34.680
Jiang Changyang doesn't like me at all.

33:35.480 --> 33:37.519
The reason we put on this act

33:37.519 --> 33:38.960
is to make you give up

33:38.960 --> 33:40.039
pressuring him to marry.

33:40.799 --> 33:42.056
Besides,

33:43.359 --> 33:45.039
I've received money for it.

33:47.279 --> 33:48.279
I'm sorry, Madam.

33:52.240 --> 33:54.480
You came to nourish my hair today.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.400
Did you also get paid for that?

33:56.400 --> 33:57.799
No, no.

33:57.799 --> 33:59.680
You have been so kind to me, Madam.

33:59.680 --> 34:01.720
It's my way of showing respect to you, Madam.

34:01.720 --> 34:03.039
It has nothing to do with Jiang Changyang.

34:04.880 --> 34:06.119
Good girl.

34:06.119 --> 34:07.279
I have not misjudged you.

34:08.079 --> 34:10.000
I have watched him grow up.

34:10.800 --> 34:13.559
And I would not misread his thoughts.

34:24.239 --> 34:26.119
Where is the Qiongtai Yulu?

34:26.119 --> 34:27.119
Madam departs today,

34:27.119 --> 34:28.480
and the flowers have been
moved onto the carriage.

34:39.039 --> 34:40.920
My lord, Madam.

34:42.840 --> 34:44.280
It's not a courtesy

34:44.280 --> 34:46.480
to steal gifts back.

34:47.960 --> 34:49.400
This plant is not easy to care for.

34:49.400 --> 34:50.480
It'll be a loss if it dies.

34:51.039 --> 34:52.320
Better to leave it with me,

34:52.320 --> 34:55.000
and next spring, you can admire
its unmatched beauty again, Auntie.

34:56.440 --> 34:57.639
But I heard

34:57.639 --> 34:59.400
that Mudan cares deeply about this flower.

34:59.920 --> 35:02.320
If you can't bear to part with it, just say so.

35:03.400 --> 35:05.400
I can't bear to part with you, my dear aunt.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.519
I want to use it as a hook

35:07.039 --> 35:08.239
to make you come back and see me more.

35:09.840 --> 35:12.360
Okay, a kind person grants
other people's wishes.

35:12.360 --> 35:13.519
For the grand wedding

35:13.519 --> 35:14.519
of my beloved nephew,

35:15.480 --> 35:16.679
I will definitely come back.

35:19.112 --> 35:21.736
[Prince Ning's Mansion]

35:22.480 --> 35:24.760
My family and I were only
able to move back to Chang'an

35:24.760 --> 35:26.880
thanks to your thoughtful
arrangements, Your Highness.

35:26.880 --> 35:28.760
I am deeply grateful.

35:28.760 --> 35:31.719
I will certainly work diligently
for you in the future.

35:33.039 --> 35:34.360
Come on, get up and speak.

35:36.159 --> 35:37.360
Thank you, Your Highness.

35:40.039 --> 35:42.039
Chang'an is different from Luoyang.

35:42.039 --> 35:44.559
The Minister of the Imperial Treasury
is in charge of finances, goods,

35:44.559 --> 35:45.960
the two capitals and four markets.

35:46.679 --> 35:48.880
This position was envied by everyone,

35:48.880 --> 35:50.280
but I overcame all objections

35:50.280 --> 35:51.400
and left it to you.

35:52.400 --> 35:53.920
Liu.

35:53.920 --> 35:55.719
Do not disappoint me.

35:58.719 --> 36:00.199
Stand up and speak.

36:00.199 --> 36:01.880
We are catching up.

36:01.880 --> 36:03.496
Don't bother with the formalities.

36:06.360 --> 36:07.599
Everyone knows

36:07.599 --> 36:08.719
that this position of mine

36:08.719 --> 36:11.079
is made of gold.

36:11.079 --> 36:12.719
You have cultivated me with great effort.

36:12.719 --> 36:15.159
I must bear the weight.

36:15.159 --> 36:16.400
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

36:31.679 --> 36:32.719
Your Highness.

36:32.719 --> 36:33.800
Before my trip,

36:33.800 --> 36:36.119
the officials of Luoyang entrusted
me to bring respectful gifts.

36:36.960 --> 36:40.808
Please take a look, Your Highness.

36:41.679 --> 36:44.880
This is presented by officials
from the Chen family clan.

36:45.840 --> 36:48.920
The rest is presented
by officials of other surnames.

36:48.920 --> 36:50.280
So many land deeds.

36:50.280 --> 36:52.599
Most of Luoyang's land is here, isn't it?

36:52.599 --> 36:53.639
Those officials

36:53.639 --> 36:54.679
obtained so many fiefdoms.

36:54.679 --> 36:56.159
Did they occupy the lands of the common people?

36:56.719 --> 36:57.840
If so,

36:57.840 --> 36:59.400
I'm afraid it may tarnish your
esteemed reputation, Your Highness.

37:02.559 --> 37:05.039
All under heaven is the king's land.

37:05.039 --> 37:06.280
Don't worry about the lowly people.

37:06.800 --> 37:09.440
Everyone even feels this chest is too small

37:09.440 --> 37:12.760
to contain the heartfelt
devotion to His Highness.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.119
Gold and silver are trivial matters.

37:17.679 --> 37:20.079
The unity of the gentry is the most important.

37:21.599 --> 37:22.960
His Majesty has a soft spot for flattery,

37:23.480 --> 37:25.679
wishing to fulfill the dying
wish of Minister Xu.

37:26.239 --> 37:28.079
But how can children of common families

37:28.079 --> 37:30.559
compete with the glory
of the great scholarly families?

37:31.159 --> 37:33.039
Your Highness is absolutely right.

37:33.599 --> 37:34.599
The hundreds of officials of Luoyang

37:34.599 --> 37:37.519
will certainly share your heart and virtue.

37:39.760 --> 37:41.719
Youzhen has a good eye indeed.

37:42.360 --> 37:43.519
Zishu,

37:43.519 --> 37:45.239
with your guidance,

37:45.239 --> 37:46.239
will surely

37:46.239 --> 37:48.320
become a pillar of strength soon.

37:51.639 --> 37:53.280
That's right.

37:53.280 --> 37:55.119
It's your first visit.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.840
I've also prepared a modest gift.

37:59.320 --> 38:00.552
Ci.

38:02.079 --> 38:03.239
Here.

38:04.400 --> 38:05.400
This one

38:05.400 --> 38:06.880
is called a Florican dog.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.679
It's a tribute from foreign lands.

38:08.679 --> 38:10.840
There are only two of them
in the palace of His Majesty.

38:11.440 --> 38:15.239
I've heard that Master Liu
is very fond of dogs.

38:15.239 --> 38:16.239
This dog

38:16.239 --> 38:17.280
is my gift to you.

38:18.400 --> 38:20.280
Thank you, Your Highness.

38:30.360 --> 38:33.199
I shall take good care of it.

38:33.920 --> 38:35.039
Good, good.

38:48.239 --> 38:49.576
Stop.

38:51.519 --> 38:53.320
Madam, we've arrived.

38:53.320 --> 38:55.280
It's the sachets from this shop here

38:55.280 --> 38:57.000
that will make one's official career prosperous

38:57.000 --> 38:58.199
and wealthy.

39:00.679 --> 39:01.880
What's the matter, Madam?

39:03.920 --> 39:05.079
Look in the mirror.

39:05.079 --> 39:06.880
Do you see the difference?

39:06.880 --> 39:08.760
Isn't that the young lady?

39:08.760 --> 39:10.800
But… I thought she died.

39:12.920 --> 39:15.920
This matter must not be known to others.

39:17.000 --> 39:20.119
Go to the office immediately
and ask the master to come home.

39:20.119 --> 39:21.639
Say there are important
matters to discuss at home.

39:21.639 --> 39:23.360
Yes, hurry back to the residence.

40:05.400 --> 40:07.199
Crimson-purple seedlings are expensive.

40:07.199 --> 40:08.360
Unexpectedly,

40:08.360 --> 40:10.440
I found several wild ones today.

40:11.480 --> 40:13.760
If I take them back and graft them
together with the Lovely Pair,

40:13.760 --> 40:15.000
they will surely produce beautiful flowers.

41:21.039 --> 41:23.000
Help! Help!

41:31.000 --> 41:32.680
Help me!

41:34.079 --> 41:35.079
Help!

41:51.960 --> 41:52.960
Help!

42:14.246 --> 42:20.520
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:22.374 --> 42:29.058
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:29.734 --> 42:36.932
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:37.926 --> 42:46.278
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:46.278 --> 42:53.821
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:54.475 --> 43:02.662
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

43:02.662 --> 43:10.473
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:11.078 --> 43:18.370
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:39.046 --> 43:45.929
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:47.230 --> 43:53.924
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:54.681 --> 44:01.983
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

44:02.667 --> 44:10.976
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:10.976 --> 44:18.407
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:19.238 --> 44:27.494
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:27.494 --> 44:34.918
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

44:35.922 --> 44:43.372
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫
